<title>USA: Sungard agrees to acquire GMI Software.</title>
<headline>Sungard agrees to acquire GMI Software.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pennsylvania 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunGard Data Systems Inc said on Monday it had reached an agreement in principle to acquire GMI Software Inc for about $30.0 million worth of its own common stock.  </p>
<p>SunGard said it did not expect the deal, which will close by January 31, 1997, to have a &quot;material impact&quot; on its financial results in 1997.</p>
<p>GMI Software, based in Chicago, specializes in the applications software market supporting exchange-traded derivatives activity.</p>
<p>SunGard provides computer service and application software.</p>
</text>
